{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bombs vs Bots is a chaotic action game featuring physics-based destruction and light environmental puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cola Corp recently purchased a new building to serve as their next headquarters. In a bid to cut costs, they began replacing their workforce with AI-powered bots - a decision that backfired spectacularly before construction was even finished. The bots gained independence, barricaded the unfinished site, and began tearing it apart in search of GPUs to make themselves more powerful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, as Cola Corp's most trusted support engineer, it's your job to clean up the mess. Fight your way through each floor, outsmart rogue machines, face off against boss encounters with unique mechanics, and turn every corridor into a fireworks display of shrapnel, sparks and debris.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explosive Combat:</strong> Use bombs, C4, and a trusty crowbar to dismantle bots and reshape the environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-based Destruction:</strong> Watch debris and bot parts scatter with satisfying, dynamic motion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light Environmental Puzzles:</strong> Find keycards, activate teleport pads, and tinker with environmental gizmos to unlock new areas and uncover useful items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Trial Mode:</strong> Speedrun cleared levels and chase your best destruction records.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements:</strong> Complete challenges and push your destructive skills to the limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Deck Optimized:</strong> Built to run at 60 FPS on the Steam Deck for smooth handheld destruction.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4120110?t=1761329447","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4120110?t=1761329447","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120110/8e677594a9d16d5d6947e6a8e1b6225aede49882/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761329447","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120110/8e677594a9d16d5d6947e6a8e1b6225aede49882/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761329447","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bombs vs Bots is a chaotic action game featuring physics-based destruction and light environmental puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cola Corp recently purchased a new building to serve as their next headquarters. In a bid to cut costs, they began replacing their workforce with AI-powered bots - a decision that backfired spectacularly before construction was even finished. The bots gained independence, barricaded the unfinished site, and began tearing it apart in search of GPUs to make themselves more powerful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, as Cola Corp's most trusted support engineer, it's your job to clean up the mess. Fight your way through each floor, outsmart rogue machines, face off against boss encounters with unique mechanics, and turn every corridor into a fireworks dis